id: architecture.self_improvement
category: architecture
status: verified
date: 2026-08-24
content: Tektos implements a Hegelian self-improvement loop — thesis (Planner spec) → antithesis (execution) → synthesis (reflection → guidance → next spec).
notes: |
  Cycle: Planning → Execution → Reflection → Synthesis → ExperienceReplay → Next Planning
  ReflectionEngine: Active contemplation, examines patterns/biases/failure modes
  SynthesisEngine: Converts reflection insights into actionable guidance for Planner
  ExperienceReplay: Cross-cycle memory, stores actionable experiences
  Quality tracking: test pass rate, artifacts count, duration trends
  Consolidation: Frequent patterns → permanent procedural memories (skills)
tags: [self-improvement, dialectic, reflection, synthesis, experience-replay]
